{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_01",
      "hash": "554d391f561df61b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "由于通过精灵球 Plus外出的\\n宝可梦被寄存到了培育屋，\\n因此无法返回。\\n\\n请取回寄存的宝可梦后再试一次。"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_02",
      "hash": "554d3a1f561df7ce",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "正在连接……\\n请勿切断电源。"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_03",
      "hash": "554d3b1f561df981",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "将宝可梦放入\\n精灵球 Plus后再外出吧！\\n\\n如果陪它一起走动玩耍的话，\\n宝可梦就会快速成长。\\n\\n如果经常陪它走动玩耍的话，\\n还能获得非常棒的奖励。"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_04",
      "hash": "554d3c1f561dfb34",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "精灵球 Plus里面\\n有一只礼物宝可梦。\\n\\n将精灵球 Plus连接为手柄后，\\n去“神秘礼物”中看看吧！\\n\\n接收礼物宝可梦之前无法外出。"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_05",
      "hash": "554d3d1f561dfce7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 4]"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_06",
      "hash": "554d3e1f561dfe9a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "正在进行准备……\\n请勿切断电源。"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_07",
      "hash": "554d3f1f561e004d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "和[VAR PKNICK(0000)]一起外出吧！\\n\\n没有玩游戏时，\\n如果[VAR COLOR(0006)]长按[VAR COLOR(0000)]精灵球 Plus的\\n[VAR COLOR(0006)]摇杆键[VAR COLOR(0000)]的话，\\n就能和[VAR PKNICK(0000)]玩耍。\\n\\n想从外面回来时，\\n请再次选择\\n“与宝可梦一起外出”。"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_08",
      "hash": "554d301f561de6d0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "请按精灵球 Plus的按键进行连接。\\n\\n精灵球 Plus连接好后，\\n请按摇杆键。"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_09",
      "hash": "554d311f561de883",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "有宝可梦正在外出。\\n要让它回来吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_10",
      "hash": "55503e1f56203471",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "请选择要外出的宝可梦。"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_11",
      "hash": "55503d1f562032be",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "这里有一份\\n其他玩家的外出记录。\\c\\n如果就这样外出的话，\\n该记录会消失，可以吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_12",
      "hash": "55503c1f5620310b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 11]"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_13",
      "hash": "55503b1f56202f58",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "有宝可梦正在外出。\\n要让它回来吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_14",
      "hash": "5550421f56203b3d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "要取消外出吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_15",
      "hash": "5550411f5620398a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "正在连接……"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_16",
      "hash": "5550401f562037d7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你和[VAR PKNICK(0000)]一起外出了，\\n并且玩得超级开心！"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_17",
      "hash": "55503f1f56203624",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你和[VAR PKNICK(0000)]一起外出了，\\n并且玩得非常开心！"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_18",
      "hash": "5550361f562026d9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你和[VAR PKNICK(0000)]一起外出了，\\n并且玩得很开心！"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_19",
      "hash": "5550351f56202526",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你和[VAR PKNICK(0000)]一起外出了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_20",
      "hash": "5553c41f56234dfa",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]获得了外出奖励！"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_20_s",
      "hash": "736f69acb4ca67c4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]获得了外出奖励！"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_21",
      "hash": "5553c51f56234fad",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "准备没有完成就无法使用。\\n要中止精灵球 Plus的准备吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_22",
      "hash": "5553c21f56234a94",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "已更新至今的外出记录！"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_23",
      "hash": "5553c31f56234c47",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "已连接到精灵球 Plus\\n以外的手柄。\\c\\n要取消外出吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_24",
      "hash": "5553c01f5623472e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "准备完成！"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_25",
      "hash": "5553c11f562348e1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "选择的宝可梦已通过\\n其他的精灵球 Plus外出了。\\c\\n如果就这样外出的话，\\n便无法接收其他\\r\\n精灵球 Plus的记录，可以吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_26",
      "hash": "5553be1f562343c8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "已完成[VAR COLOR(0002)][VAR NUM9(0000,0000)][VAR COLOR(0000)]次\\n“[VAR COLOR(0002)]一同行走[VAR COLOR(0000)]”！"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_27",
      "hash": "5553bf1f5623457b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "已完成[VAR COLOR(0002)][VAR NUM9(0000,0000)][VAR COLOR(0000)]次\\n“[VAR COLOR(0002)]玩耍[VAR COLOR(0000)]”！"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_28",
      "hash": "5553bc1f56234062",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "已完成[VAR COLOR(0002)][VAR NUM9(0000,0000)][VAR COLOR(0000)]次\\n“[VAR COLOR(0002)]玩得很开心[VAR COLOR(0000)]”！"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_29",
      "hash": "5553bd1f56234215",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "已完成[VAR COLOR(0002)][VAR NUM9(0000,0000)][VAR COLOR(0000)]次\\n“[VAR COLOR(0002)]玩得非常开心[VAR COLOR(0000)]”！"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_30",
      "hash": "55572a1f56263123",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "已完成[VAR COLOR(0002)][VAR NUM9(0000,0000)][VAR COLOR(0000)]次\\n“[VAR COLOR(0002)]呼唤[VAR TRNAME(0001)][VAR COLOR(0000)]”！"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_31",
      "hash": "5557291f56262f70",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "已完成[VAR COLOR(0002)][VAR NUM9(0000,0000)][VAR COLOR(0000)]次\\n“[VAR COLOR(0002)]回应呼唤[VAR COLOR(0000)]”！"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_32",
      "hash": "55572c1f56263489",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "已完成[VAR COLOR(0002)][VAR NUM9(0000,0000)][VAR COLOR(0000)]次\\n“[VAR COLOR(0002)]努力游玩Pokémon GO[VAR COLOR(0000)]”！"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_33",
      "hash": "55572b1f562632d6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "已完成[VAR COLOR(0002)][VAR NUM9(0000,0000)][VAR COLOR(0000)]次\\n“[VAR COLOR(0002)]帮助Pokémon GO[VAR COLOR(0000)]”！"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_34",
      "hash": "55572e1f562637ef",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "正在写入记录……\\n请勿切断电源。"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "id": "mb_ctr_cap_01",
      "hash": "8040b256847fd729",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "退出"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "id": "mb_ctr_cap_02",
      "hash": "8040af56847fd210",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "【本次外出记录】"
    },
